<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Stand on the block of bedrock you want to destroy, stand straight and look down. Make sure, that u have at least 2 obsidian in the first slot, 1 lever in the second slot, at least 2 Tnt in the 3 slot, 1 trapdoor ub the fourth slot and at least 2 pistons in the fifth slot.
sensitivity: 800 dpi
sensitivity ingame: 80%
Fullscreen Resolution: 3840x2160, 24 bit, 120 fps
Graphics: fullscreen
Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
